@startuml shortlist-compare-sequence
title WF-01 | Compare Shortlisted Creators
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam maxMessageSize 245

actor Brand
participant "Web Client" as Web
participant ShortlistController as Controller
participant ShortlistCompareService as Service
participant CampaignRepository as Campaigns
participant ShortlistItemRepository as Items
participant PublicCreatorMetricRepository as Metrics

Brand -> Web : choose channels for comparison
Web -> Controller : POST /api/v1/campaigns/{campaignId}/shortlist/compare\ncreatorIds
activate Controller
alt <U+005B>request does not contain 2-5 non-null channel IDs (BR-51)<U+005D>
  Controller --> Web : 400 Bad Request
else <U+005B>request size and IDs pass validation<U+005D>
  Controller -> Service : compare(campaignId, request)
  activate Service
  note over Service : Read-only REPEATABLE_READ transaction. MANAGE_OWN_SHORTLIST required.
  Service -> Campaigns : findById(campaignId)
  Campaigns --> Service : campaign or empty
  alt <U+005B>campaign missing or owned by another Brand (BR-49)<U+005D>
    Service --> Controller : NotFoundException
    Controller --> Web : 404 Not Found
  else <U+005B>owned campaign found but IDs repeat<U+005D>
    Service --> Controller : ValidationException
    Controller --> Web : 400 Bad Request
  else <U+005B>owned campaign and distinct channel IDs<U+005D>
    Service -> Items : findByCampaignIdAndCreatorIdIn(campaignId, ids)
    Items --> Service : matching shortlist items
    alt <U+005B>any channel absent, removed or belongs to another user<U+005D>
      Service --> Controller : ValidationException
      Controller --> Web : 400 Bad Request
    else <U+005B>all channels in the caller's active shortlist<U+005D>
      Service -> Metrics : latestForCreators(ids)
      Metrics --> Service : latest public metric snapshot per available channel
      note over Service, Metrics
        Order snapshots by collected_at DESC, then ID DESC.
        Return metric ID, collection time and freshness when present.
        If a channel has no snapshot, return metrics = null.
        Preserve the input order of channels for comparison.
      end note
      Service --> Controller : CompareDtos.Response
      Controller --> Web : 200 OK with comparison data
    end
  end
  deactivate Service
end
deactivate Controller
@enduml
